{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14793","headline":"赴池州拜觐舅氏留上考功郎中舅 · 卢纶","name":"赴池州拜觐舅氏留上考功郎中舅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"孤贱易磋砣，其如酷似何。\n衰荣同族少，生长外家多。\n别国桑楡在，沾衣血泪和。\n应怜失行鴈，霜霰寄烟波。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14793.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14793","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}